      en: ["Capital 893–972", "Center of Slavic writing", "Round Golden Church", "Archaeological reserve"],
      es: ["Capital 893–972", "Centro de la escritura eslava", "Iglesia redonda dorada", "Reserva arqueológica"],
      pt: ["Capital 893–972", "Centro da escrita eslava", "Igreja redonda dourada", "Reserva arqueológica"],
      fr: ["Capitale 893–972", "Centre de l'écriture slave", "Église ronde dorée", "Réserve archéologique"],
